  "caption": {
    "hashtags": [],
    "public_preview": null,
    "text": "And nothing has ever been the same since. 🥲\n\nLife has changed in so many ways. Things have gotten complicated and life can be a lot at times.\n\nWe’re not kids anymore. This is the real world. There are no more all knowing adults to take care of everything for us, or tell us everything will be okay.\n\nIt’s up to us now to decide how we live our lives and where we end up. It’s a lot of responsibility none of us asked for, but here we are.\n\nIt can be overwhelming. Trust me, I feel all the same pressure as you, I get it.\n\nBut one thing I’ve learned is that no matter how hard things get or how complicated life becomes we always adapt.\n\nWe’re stronger and more capable than we realize.\n\nIf you’re reading this, you’ve overcome every single challenge so far. You’re still here, still breathing, still pushing forward.\n\nYou should be proud of yourself. It hasn’t been easy. And the hard truth is that it doesn’t get easier.\n\nYou just become stronger. More resilient. More wise.\n\nYou’re going to continue to grow and evolve. You’re going to realize that no matter what life throws at you, you will be okay.\n\nOur parents might not be telling us that anymore but that’s okay, because we’re learning how to tell it to ourselves, and actually believe it.\n\nI believe in you, because I believe in me. We’re all gonna make it. We’re all gonna be okay. \n\nWe got this ❤️\n\nWords by, @thehunterfogarty",
    "word_count": 271
  },
